==> the plan
disks (3): vtbd0 (10 GiB, /dev/vda in the plan, found by order), vtbd1 (10 GiB, /dev/vdb in the plan, found by order), vtbd2 (10 GiB, /dev/vdc in the plan, found by size)
  vtbd0: 1: 512K bios, 2: 512M efi, 3: 2G swap, 4: rest zfs (zroot)
  vtbd1: 1: 512K bios, 2: 512M efi, 3: 2G swap, 4: rest zfs (zroot)
  vtbd2: 1: 512K bios, 2: 512M efi, 3: 2G swap, 4: rest zfs (zroot)
  zroot: raidz over vtbd0 vtbd1 vtbd2, at /; the system in zroot/ROOT/default, a boot environment
